> "- editor -" (row 0, column 11), "play" (row 3, column 19, attribute $39), "reset" (row 3, column 26), then two blanks: 10 spaces over the title and 14 spaces at column 18 whose row byte EditorStart / EditorPlay patch to 2, 3, 4 (and 5). The first three read once in m1 (6262); EditorButtonsBlank 4 times; EditorTitleBlank once, in e1 (EditorPlay, frame 840).
