$C58D b EditorCursorSpeed ; The cursor's step counter: high nibble frames left, low nibble the speed (1-5), $F1 at a start
> Read and written by EditorStart's loop (m1 240 reads).
$C58E EditorBallSpeed ; the same for the moved ball (never used in a recording)
